Article 19

The implementation of Women's Empowerment in the social field as referred to in Article 12 paragraph (2) letter h shall be carried out by Regional Apparatus that administer governmental affairs in the social field and other related agencies in the form of:
a. awareness-raising efforts and capacity building in the social field;
b. provision and development of access for women to participate in the social field;
c. enhancement of women's competence through training and social education for women;
d. involvement of women in social activities; and
e. cultivation and development of women's forums or institutions in the social field.

Article 21

The implementation of Women's Empowerment in the field of environment as referred to in Article 12 paragraph (2) letter j shall be carried out by Regional Apparatus that administer governmental affairs in the field of environment and other related agencies in the form of:
a. awareness-raising and formation of environmentally conscious behavior among women;
b. enhancement of women's capacity and competence through environmental training and education;
c. provision and development of women's access to participate in the environmental field;
d. involvement of women in environmental activities; and
e. cultivation and development of women's forums or institutions in the environmental field.

